request.description:
Server Action: getAdminUsers({ search: 'john' })
Import: import { getAdminUsers } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

Search is case-insensitive and matches across: fullName, email, organization name.

Server Action: getAdminUsers({ tab: 'marketplace' })
Import: import { getAdminUsers } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

Returns only users with an active MARKETPLACE or BUNDLE plan.

Server Action: getAdminUsers({ tab: 'predict' })
Import: import { getAdminUsers } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

Returns only users with an active PREDICT or BUNDLE plan.

Server Action: getAdminUsers({ tab: 'paid' })
Import: import { getAdminUsers } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

Returns users with PREDICT, MARKETPLACE, or BUNDLE active subscriptions.

Server Action: getAdminUsers({ status: 'deactivated' })
Import: import { getAdminUsers } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

Status values: 'active' | 'deactivated'

Server Action: getAdminUsers({ tab, search, plan, status, page, limit })
Import: import { getAdminUsers } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

All filters can be combined. Pagination: page starts at 1, max limit is 100.

Server Action: deactivateAdminUser(userId)
Import: import { deactivateAdminUser } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

Sets isActive = false. User cannot log in but all data is preserved.
Can be reversed with activateAdminUser().

Returns: { id, fullName, email, isActive: false }

Server Action: activateAdminUser(userId)
Import: import { activateAdminUser } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

Sets isActive = true. Restores access for a deactivated user.

Returns: { id, fullName, email, isActive: true }

Server Action: deleteAdminUser(userId)
Import: import { deleteAdminUser } from '@/actions/admin-user-management.actions';

⚠️ IRREVERSIBLE from the UI. Sets deletedAt timestamp and isActive = false.
User will not appear in any list queries after this.
All historical data (subscriptions, payments) is preserved for audit.

Returns: { id, fullName, email, deletedAt }
